  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 5301.12 Instructor preparation course",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 5301.12 \"Instructor preparation course\" means a course established by the MSF which an instructor-trainee takes and passes in order to become an instructor. The term includes \"rider coach preparation workshop\".\n\nSource. #8403, eff 8-2-05; ss by #10589, eff 5-14-14; ss by #14174, eff 1-17-25 (formerly Saf-C 5301.13)",
